WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:08.122
"Woof! Woof!" said Dog.

2
00:00:08.123 --> 00:00:15.130
"Woof! Woof! Woof!"

3
00:00:15.131 --> 00:00:19.610
"That is not Dog's happy bark," said Cow.

4
00:00:19.611 --> 00:00:23.515
"Something is wrong!"

5
00:00:23.516 --> 00:00:35.644
Pig and Cat ran outside.

6
00:00:35.645 --> 00:00:41.738
They ran to Red Bird's tree.

7
00:00:41.739 --> 00:00:46.492
There was Dog.

8
00:00:46.493 --> 00:00:50.095
"I saw something," said Dog.

9
00:00:50.096 --> 00:00:54.774
"It was black. It was big!"

10
00:00:54.775 --> 00:00:58.216
"How big was it?" asked Cat.

11
00:00:58.217 --> 00:01:02.066
"It was bigger than Farmer!" said Dog.

12
00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:08.860
"And it ate Red Bird's food!"

13
00:01:08.861 --> 00:01:14.699
"It's a monster," said Cat.

14
00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:18.916
"A hungry monster!" said Pig.

15
00:01:18.917 --> 00:01:23.080
"I barked and barked," said Dog.

16
00:01:23.081 --> 00:01:26.806
"I barked until it ran away."

17
00:01:26.807 --> 00:01:30.210
"Will it come back?" asked Pig.

18
00:01:30.211 --> 00:01:34.165
"Will it eat us?" asked Cat.

19
00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:36.893
"No," said Dog.

20
00:01:36.894 --> 00:01:42.394
"I will watch the farm.

21
00:01:42.395 --> 00:01:46.147
I will keep us safe."

